        "body": "Hello and thank you for the effort put into this library!\r\nPerhaps it's an issue on my end but after integrating `calf-imagePicker` into my `shared` module, `iOS` compilation fails with the following exception: \r\n```\r\njava.lang.IllegalStateException: FIELD name:com_mohamedrejeb_calf_picker_FilePickerFileType_Image$stable type:kotlin.Int visibility:public [final,static]\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn Android everything works well.\r\nAnd on `iOS` it compiles if I don't specify `FilePickerFileType` or `FilePickerSelectionMode`. So relying on default arguments works for some reason.\r\n\r\nAny ideas as to what might be causing this?\r\nThanks!",
